+    // modest constant c (Higham, Accuracy and Stability, ch. 19). With
+    // n = max(rows, cols) <= 6 we take c = 32 for headroom. The floor at
+    // f64::MIN_POSITIVE keeps the tolerance from underflowing to exactly
+    // zero when all drawn entries are subnormal-scale.
+    #[hegel::test]
